ne-flex origin-left items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-medium underline underline-offset-4 decoration-ink/40 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-110 hover:decoration-ink\" href=\"/gallery\">Full gallery<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"inline-block translate-x-0 opacity-100 transition-all duration-300 sm:-translate-x-2 sm:opacity-0 sm:group-hover:translate-x-0 sm:group-hover:opacity-100\">→</span></a></div></div></section><section class=\"overflow-hidden bg-ink text-cream\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"relative order-2 min-h-[420px] lg:order-1 lg:min-h-[640px]\"><img alt=\"Inside the studio, the cape with the bear mark\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/chair-wash.jpg\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-ink/20\"></div></div><div class=\"relative order-1 flex flex-col justify-center px-6 py-24 md:px-12 lg:order-2 lg:px-20 lg:py-32\"><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"\" class=\"bear-mask shrink-0 absolute -right-1 -bottom-1 text-cream opacity-[0.05]\" style=\"width:280px;height:280px\"></span><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-cream/50\">03 · The Standard</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h2 class=\"heading-1 mt-5\"><span class=\"block\">Clean studio.</span><span class=\"block\">Serious work.</span></h2></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed text-cream/80\">The studio is built for people who care how they look when they leave. No crowd, no rush, no extra noise. Just a clean room, one chair, and enough time to get the cut right. We keep the space focused and personal so every appointment gets its full attention from start to finish.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mono-micro mt-16 text-cream/50 lg:mt-10\">One-on-One · Clean Space · Full Attention</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"px-6 py-24 md:px-12 lg:px-20 lg:py-28\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] items-center gap-14 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20\"><div class=\"lg:translate-x-[30px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-stone-500\">04 · The Space</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><h2 class=\"heading-1 mt-5 italic\"><span class=\"block md:inline\">Inside Bellazio.</span></h2></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-stone-700\">Tedi&#x27;s studio is inside Bellazio Collective in Matawan. It is not a walk-in shop and it is not built for waiting around. It is one room, one chair, and a clean setup made for focused appointments. You show up on time, sit down, and get the cut handled right.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><p class=\"mono-micro mt-10 text-stone-500\">259-267 Broad St, Suite 128<!-- --> · Matawan, NJ</p></div></div><div class=\"lg:-translate-x-[30px]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"hairline relative ml-auto aspect-[4/5] w-full max-w-md overflow-hidden\"><img alt=\"The studio entrance at Bellazio Collective\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" src=\"/professional-images/outsidedoor.jpg\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-stone-100 px-6 pt-10 pb-5 md:px-12 md:pt-16 md:pb-8 lg:px-20 lg:pt-36 lg:pb-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1440px]\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\"><p class=\"eyebrow text-stone-500\">05 · Our Reviews</p><p class=\"whitespace-nowrap font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[0.12em] text-stone-500 uppercase sm:text-xs\">168<!-- --> five-star reviews</p></div><h2 class=\"heading-1 mt-3 md:mt-5\">Five star reviews, ONLY.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-5 md:mt-14 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6\"><div class=\"flex\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1231797_tedis-hair-studio_barber-shop_28674_matawan#business-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Read James P.&#x27;s review on Booksy\" class=\"group flex flex-1\"><figure class=\"hairline-strong flex flex-1 flex-col bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:bg-bone group-hover:shadow-lg sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-6xl leading-none text-forest\">“</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-2\" aria-label=\"5 star review\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 text-neon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"mono-micro text-stone-500\">5<!-- -->.0</span></div></div><blockquote class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700\">Perfect haircut every single time, you are not rushed and he pays attention to every detail</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mono-micro mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 text-stone-500 sm:mt-8\"><span class=\"text-ink\">James P.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Aug 2026</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-forest\">via Booksy ↗</span></figcaption></figure></a></div><div class=\"flex\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1231797_tedis-hair-studio_barber-shop_28674_matawan#business-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Read Jacob R.&#x27;s review on Booksy\" class=\"group flex flex-1\"><figure class=\"hairline-strong flex flex-1 flex-col bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:bg-bone group-hover:shadow-lg sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-6xl leading-none text-forest\">“</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-2\" aria-label=\"5 star review\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 text-neon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg></div><span class=\"mono-micro text-stone-500\">5<!-- -->.0</span></div></div><blockquote class=\"mt-2 flex-1 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-stone-700\">He did exactly what my son asked him to do. The shop is clean and inviting. He ran on time. We continue to return for haircuts for my very picky teenage son.</blockquote><figcaption class=\"mono-micro mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-2.5 text-stone-500 sm:mt-8\"><span class=\"text-ink\">Jacob R.</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span>Jul 2026</span><span aria-hidden=\"true\">·</span><span class=\"text-forest\">via Booksy ↗</span></figcaption></figure></a></div><div class=\"flex\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1231797_tedis-hair-studio_barber-shop_28674_matawan#business-reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"Read Matthew G.&#x27;s review on Booksy\" class=\"group flex flex-1\"><figure class=\"hairline-strong flex flex-1 flex-col bg-cream p-6 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:-translate-y-1 group-hover:bg-bone group-hover:shadow-lg sm:p-8\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"font-display text-6xl leading-none text-forest\">“</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 pt-2\" aria-label=\"5 star review\"><div class=\"flex gap-1 text-neon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path></svg><svg viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"size-3.5\"><path d=\"M10 1.5 12.5 7l6 .6-4.5 4.1 1.3 5.8L10 14.5l-5.3 3 1.3-5.8-4.5-4.1 6-.6L10 1.5Z\"></path